{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible then approach and pick up, move to destination, perform specific task; otherwise scan for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    />\"",
